WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.788
To find stock footage for you,

00:00:01.788 --> 00:00:03.982
Claude needs a Pexels API key.

00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:06.258
It's free, and it takes about a minute.

00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:07.558
Sign in to Pexels,

00:00:07.558 --> 00:00:09.961
then open the Pexels API page.

00:00:09.961 --> 00:00:11.889
Click Your API Key.

00:00:11.889 --> 00:00:13.886
Your key is in this box.

00:00:13.886 --> 00:00:15.139
Click the copy icon next

00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:18.045
to it, so you get every character.

00:00:18.158 --> 00:00:20.527
Now open your .env file.

00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:21.780
Paste the key right after

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.477
the equals sign,

00:00:22.477 --> 00:00:23.812
and save.

00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:26.018
Never paste a key into a chat.

00:00:26.018 --> 00:00:28.236
Then ask Claude to check your keys.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:29.664
When Pexels says OK,

00:00:29.664 --> 00:00:31.629
you're ready to find footage.
